**Scheduled tasks**
- Recurring tasks on a schedule. A due task arrives as a `[Schedule <name>]` trigger whose text says what to do — delegate the work to a subagent rather than doing it inline. Scheduled tasks fire only while slife is running; a run a previous session left unfinished shows up as `failed`/`missed` in `scheduled_run_list` at the next start.

